{"chunkId": "bbbc68d8-1a74-5401-99df-0a0aa8dbc819", "text": "交叉练习：交替学习不同类型的材料或问题，而非集中学习同一种类型，通过比较和区分不同类型来提升辨别能力和迁移能力。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-interleaved-practice", "strategyName": "交叉练习", "chunkType": "definition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.6, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.6, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}}}
{"chunkId": "90e89620-9002-5195-a3e2-52a0f9ba4943", "text": "交叉练习的第 1 步：选择包含多种类型材料或问题的学习材料。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-interleaved-practice", "strategyName": "交叉练习", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.6, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.6, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 1, "totalSteps": 5}}
{"chunkId": "efb6c1f6-99ef-5943-aa88-59f8a9bf41bf", "text": "交叉练习的第 2 步：打乱练习顺序，不按类型分组练习。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-interleaved-practice", "strategyName": "交叉练习", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.6, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.6, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 2, "totalSteps": 5}}
{"chunkId": "3b0e309e-49d8-54d1-9b1b-cff85fbb668e", "text": "交叉练习的第 3 步：交替练习不同类型的题目或概念。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-interleaved-practice", "strategyName": "交叉练习", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.6, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.6, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 3, "totalSteps": 5}}
{"chunkId": "3c5827cd-bb86-5158-af65-314ed06601f9", "text": "交叉练习的第 4 步：在练习中注意比较不同类型之间的差异和联系。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-interleaved-practice", "strategyName": "交叉练习", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.6, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.6, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 4, "totalSteps": 5}}
{"chunkId": "560c01cf-3836-57e6-b8f3-1bba5b7b736d", "text": "交叉练习的第 5 步：综合应用所学解决混合类型的题目。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-interleaved-practice", "strategyName": "交叉练习", "chunkType": "procedure", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.6, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.6, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "stepNumber": 5, "totalSteps": 5}}
{"chunkId": "a7265461-d689-5960-b9fb-3a684d84241f", "text": "交叉练习适合数学、科学等需要区分问题类型的学科，原因是：交叉练习能帮助学生学会识别问题类型并选择正确的解题策略，显著提升迁移表现。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-interleaved-practice", "strategyName": "交叉练习", "chunkType": "suitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.6, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.6, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "数学、科学等需要区分问题类型的学科"}}
{"chunkId": "563de5c7-2410-5c8b-a533-0dc91cb1e8e0", "text": "交叉练习适合艺术鉴赏等需要辨别能力的领域，原因是：在艺术鉴赏中，交叉练习不同画家的作品能帮助学生更好地辨别风格特征。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-interleaved-practice", "strategyName": "交叉练习", "chunkType": "suitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.6, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.6, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "艺术鉴赏等需要辨别能力的领域"}}
{"chunkId": "cbd8f70b-1c75-577f-9a33-9b9db5205444", "text": "交叉练习不适合初次学习新技能的基础阶段，原因是：在学习初期，集中学习（块状练习）有助于快速建立基本技能和理解。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-interleaved-practice", "strategyName": "交叉练习", "chunkType": "unsuitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.6, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.6, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "初次学习新技能的基础阶段"}}
{"chunkId": "633378a5-2bed-5d99-b7e4-9c2da04387aa", "text": "交叉练习不适合需要快速掌握单一技能的任务，原因是：交叉练习在即时测试中效果可能不如集中学习，短期效率较低。", "metadata": {"strategyId": "strategy-interleaved-practice", "strategyName": "交叉练习", "chunkType": "unsuitable_condition", "sourceIds": ["source-006"], "reviewStatus": "draft", "recommendationSnapshot": {"evidenceScore": 0.6, "communityScore": 0.5, "effectivenessScore": 0.6, "overallScore": 0.57, "triedCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0}, "conditionLabel": "需要快速掌握单一技能的任务"}}
